              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p><b><i>accommodation bond balance</i></b> has the meaning given by the Dictionary in Schedule 1 to the <i>Aged Care Act 1997</i>.</p>
                  <p><b><i>accommodation payment</i></b><b><i> balance</i></b> means:</p>
